66	cpy-abs	MAN:S8-43	CPY absolute with Y equal to the cell $80 (S8-43): Z and C set, N clear, the masked P byte is $03
67	asl-modes	MAN:S8-19	ASL absolute ($01 gives $02), zero page,X ($04 gives $08) and absolute,X ($10 gives $20) shift left (S8-19): the ORed results are $2A
