69	lsr-modes	MAN:S8-56	LSR zero page ($02 gives $01), zero page,X ($08 gives $04) and absolute,X ($20 gives $10) shift right (S8-56): the ORed results are $15
70	ror-modes	MAN:S8-69	ROR zero page ($02 gives $81), absolute ($08 gives $84) and zero page,X ($20 gives $90) with C set rotate right through C (S8-69): the ORed results are $95
