72	inc-modes	MAN:S8-48	INC zero page,X ($03 gives $04) and absolute,X ($0F gives $10) add one (S8-48): the ORed results are $14
73	bit-abs	MAN:S8-25	BIT absolute on the cell $C0 with A = $00 and C clear (S8-25): N = M7 = 1, V = M6 = 1, Z = 1 and C unchanged, the masked P byte is $C2
74	bit-zpx	MAN:S8-25	BIT zero page,X (X = 3) on the cell $40 with A = $FF and C set (S8-25): N = 0, V = 1, Z = 0 and C unchanged, the masked P byte is $41
75	trb-abs	ASSUMED:LED-CPU-0010	TRB absolute on the cell $3C with A = $0F stores not A AND M (the formula of S8-102; its prose says the result is not stored, the stored reading is the project's): the cell reads $30
76	tst-abs	MAN:S8-104	TST #imm,absolute with the immediate $0F on the cell $F0 (S8-104): Z = 1 (the AND is zero), N = M7 = 1, V = M6 = 1 and C unchanged with C clear, the masked P byte is $C2
